<rml><head><title>Video export and queue</title><link type="text/template" href="../../components/dialog.rml"/><link type="text/rcss" href="theatre.rcss"/></head>
<body template="prime-dialog"><div id="replay_export_panel" class="prime_dialog"><h2>VIDEO EXPORT &amp; QUEUE</h2><p id="replay_export_replay"/><p>Choose the reviewed marks, full replay or saved reel. Camera track exports use saved keyframes. Accepted jobs continue after returning to the Library. You can open and edit another replay while rendering.</p><p id="replay_export_range"/><label for="replay_export_executable">ENCODER EXECUTABLE (LEAVE BLANK FOR PNG + WAV)</label><input id="replay_export_executable" type="text" maxlength="32768" value="ffmpeg"/><p id="replay_export_audio_summary"/>
<div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_export_source" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-source">SOURCE</button><button id="replay_export_camera" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-camera">CAMERA</button><button id="replay_export_refresh" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-refresh">REFRESH REVIEW</button></div>
<div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_export_preset" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-preset">PRESET</button><button id="replay_export_resolution" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-resolution">RESOLUTION</button><button id="replay_export_fps" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-fps">FPS</button><button id="replay_export_encoder" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-encoder">ENCODER</button></div>
<div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_export_game_hud" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-game-hud">GAME HUD</button><button id="replay_export_replay_overlay" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-replay-overlay">REPLAY OVERLAY</button><button id="replay_export_queue" class="play_action primary" data-action="replay:export-queue">QUEUE VIDEO EXPORT</button></div>
<p>Game HUD includes the hunter HUD and notices. Replay overlay includes replay status. Editor panels are excluded from exported video.</p><p id="replay_export_progress"/><p id="replay_export_active"/><p id="replay_export_pending"/>
<div class="theatre_actions"><button id="replay_export_previous" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-previous">PREVIOUS PENDING</button><button id="replay_export_next" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-next">NEXT PENDING</button><button id="replay_export_cancel_active" class="play_action danger" data-action="replay:export-cancel-active">CANCEL ACTIVE...</button><button id="replay_export_retry" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-retry">RETRY ORIGINAL...</button><button id="replay_export_clear_pending" class="play_action danger" data-action="replay:export-clear-pending">CLEAR PENDING...</button></div>
<p id="replay_export_failures" class="bookmark_error"/><p id="replay_export_output"/><button id="replay_export_open_output" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-open-output">OPEN COMPLETED OUTPUT FOLDER</button><p id="replay_export_status"/><p id="replay_export_error" class="bookmark_error"/><button id="replay_export_close" class="play_action" data-action="replay:export-close">RETURN TO PLAYBACK</button>
</div></body></rml>